        </html:div>

        <html:div>
            <html:details name="front-page-group">
                <html:summary>about</html:summary>
                <html:div class="details-div" style="max-width: 24rem;padding:0.6em;font-size: 1.3rem;">
                    <html:span>a game about self-locating uncertainty</html:span>
                    <html:a id="github" href="https://github.com/landgreen/n-gon" aria-label="github">
                        <ns5:svg xmlns:ns5="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="-19 -8 40 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="#333" stroke-width="0.4">
                            <ns5:defs>
                                <ns5:lineargradient id="horizontalGradient" x1="-8" y1="0" x2="8" y2="0" gradientunits="userSpaceOnUse">
                                    <ns5:stop offset="0%" stop-color="#e0e3e6"/>
                                    <ns5:stop offset="100%" stop-color="#fff"/>
                                </ns5:lineargradient>
                            </ns5:defs>
                            <ns5:circle cx="0" cy="0" r="7" fill="url(#horizontalGradient)"/>
                            <ns5:circle cx="4" cy="0" r="1.1" fill="none"/>
                            <ns5:path d="M5.3 0 h1.7" stroke="#1B1F23"/>
                        </ns5:svg>
                    </html:a>
                    <html:p>
                        I wrote n-gon in JavaScript, CSS, and HTML using the matter.js 2-D physics library.
                        The code is free and open source on <html:a id="github" href="https://github.com/landgreen/n-gon" aria-label="github">GitHub</html:a>.
                        This is just my hobby project, but I try to fix bugs when <html:a id="github" href="https://github.com/landgreen/n-gon/issues" aria-label="github">reported</html:a>.
                    </html:p>

                    <html:span style="max-width: 25rem; line-height: 180%;">
                        <html:label for="classic-select" title="play older versions of n-gon">classic n-gon:</html:label>
                        <html:select name="classic-select" id="classic-select" onchange="window.location.href=this.value">
